      "value": "@{603ad7b22fa90e5c535fe409|full_name} mhm\n\nwhen I was able to trigger the bug using an alt account, since my game was already going haywire with the issue, I was able to document some of the specific behaviors, and trying to figure out what leads up to it.\n\nearmuff mode can help make the colossal chatboxes go away but obviously that's not a solution for everyone.\n\nedit: or you can just turn them off, I forgot that's a thing. but presents the same problems.\n\nI had my game client give a very verbose log output with all publicly known launch arguments that affects how logging works, for debugging purposes and had a friend forward it for me.",
